("bay-club","Bay Club","https://www.bayclubs.com/","Bay Club grew from the San Francisco Bay Club, which opened in 1977.","The navy circle with stacked type looks like a club badge.","The friendly lettering keeps a premium club approachable.",[("navy circle",0.1,0.3),("stacked words",0.6,0.45),("California clubs",0.85,0.85)]),
